<title>USA: AmeriConnect to select voters by Sept. 3.</title>
<headline>AmeriConnect to select voters by Sept. 3.</headline>
<dateline>OVERLAND PARK, Kan. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmeriConnect Inc said Thursday it established the close of business September 3 as the record date for determining the stockholders entitled to vote at a special stockholders meeting to be held to consider a proposed merger with a wholly-owned subsidiary of Phoenix Network Inc.</p>
<p>The meeting is tentatively scheduled for October 7.</p>
</text>
